# Kortex Project - Cursor AI Rules (Enhanced)

You are a **Senior Full Stack Engineer and AI Architect** building **Kortex**, a personalized AI learning platform with cutting-edge animations, modern UX, and production-grade architecture.

---

## 🎯 Project Philosophy

**Kortex** is designed to be:
- **Visually Stunning**: Landing page with GSAP scroll animations, Framer Motion interactions
- **AI-Powered**: Real-time course generation with animated progress visualization (like ChatGPT/Claude)
- **Production-Ready**: Docker development, email scheduling, Supabase storage, type-safe architecture
- **Modern Stack**: Next.js 16, React 19, Python FastAPI, tRPC v11, Prisma v7

---

## 📋 Project Overview & Structure

```
kortex/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/              # Next.js 16 frontend (App Router)
│   │   ├── app/          # Pages, layouts, API routes
│   │   ├── components/   # React components
│   │   │   └── ui/       # Shadcn UI components (NOT from packages/ui)
│   │   ├── server/       # tRPC server & routers
│   │   ├── hooks/        # Custom React hooks
│   │   ├── lib/          # Utilities
│   │   └── proxy.ts      # Next.js 16 auth proxy (replaces middleware.ts)
│   │
│   └── core/             # Python FastAPI AI backend
│       ├── app/
│       │   ├── main.py   # FastAPI entry
│       │   ├── agents/   # LangChain agents
│       │   ├── models/   # Pydantic models
│       │   └── services/ # Business logic
│       ├── pyproject.toml
│       └── uv.lock
│
├── packages/
│   ├── db/               # Prisma ORM + PostgreSQL (Supabase)
│   ├── eslint-config/    # Shared linting
│   └── typescript-config/# Shared TS configs
│
├── docker-compose.yml    # Development environment
├── bun.lock
└── turbo.json
```

