### Database (`packages/db`)

#### **Prisma ORM v7+** (Released 2024)
- **Major Changes**:
  - Rust-free (TypeScript-based)
  - Uses driver adapters (`@prisma/adapter-pg` for PostgreSQL)
  - 5x faster type checking
  - Better edge runtime support

- **Setup**:
  ```prisma
  // schema.prisma
  generator client {
    provider = "prisma-client"
  }
  
  datasource db {
    provider = "postgresql"
    url      = env("DATABASE_URL") // Supabase connection string
  }
  
  model User {
    id        String   @id @default(cuid())
    email     String   @unique
    xp        Int      @default(0)
    level     Int      @default(1)
    createdAt DateTime @default(now())
    courses   CourseEnrollment[]
  }
  
  model Course {
    id          String   @id @default(cuid())
    title       String
    description String   @db.Text
    lessons     Lesson[]
    enrollments CourseEnrollment[]
  }
  ```

- **With Supabase**:
  ```typescript
  // lib/db.ts
  import { PrismaClient } from '@prisma/client'
  
  const globalForPrisma = globalThis as unknown as {
    prisma: PrismaClient | undefined
  }
  
  export const db =
    globalForPrisma.prisma ??
    new PrismaClient({
      log: ['query', 'error', 'warn'],
    })
  
  if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') globalForPrisma.prisma = db
  ```

- **Workflow**:
  ```bash
  cd packages/db
  bunx prisma db push          # Push schema changes
  bunx prisma generate         # Regenerate client
  bunx prisma studio           # Visual database browser
  bunx prisma migrate dev      # Create migration (production)
  ```

#### **Supabase Integration**
- **PostgreSQL**: Database backend
- **Storage**: File uploads (images, videos, documents)
- **Real-time**: Subscriptions for live updates
- **Auth** (optional): Can use Supabase Auth or Clerk

