## 🐳 Docker Development

### **Docker Compose v5** (Version field obsolete)
- **Breaking**: Version jumped from v2 to v5 (skipped 3 & 4 to avoid confusion)
- **No longer need** `version:` field in `docker-compose.yml`

- **Setup**:
  ```yaml
  # docker-compose.yml (NO version field)
  name: kortex-dev
  
  services:
    postgres:
      image: postgres:16-alpine
      environment:
        POSTGRES_USER: kortex
        POSTGRES_PASSWORD: dev_password
        POSTGRES_DB: kortex_dev
      ports:
        - "5432:5432"
      volumes:
        - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    
    redis:
      image: redis:7-alpine
      ports:
        - "6379:6379"
    
    web:
      build:
        context: ./apps/web
        dockerfile: Dockerfile.dev
      ports:
        - "3000:3000"
      volumes:
        - ./apps/web:/app
        - /app/node_modules
      environment:
        DATABASE_URL: postgresql://kortex:dev_password@postgres:5432/kortex_dev
      depends_on:
        - postgres
        - redis
    
    core:
      build:
        context: ./apps/core
        dockerfile: Dockerfile.dev
      ports:
        - "8000:8000"
      volumes:
        - ./apps/core:/app
      environment:
        DATABASE_URL: postgresql://kortex:dev_password@postgres:5432/kortex_dev
      depends_on:
        - postgres
  
  volumes:
    postgres_data:
  ```

- **Commands**:
  ```bash
  docker compose up -d          # Start services (note: no hyphen)
  docker compose down           # Stop services
  docker compose logs -f web    # View logs
  docker compose restart core   # Restart service
  ```

